{save true}{false}ifelse}{false}ifelse
11 dict begin
/FontType 1 def
/FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0 ]readonly def
/FontName /URAZQA+CMR9 def
/FontBBox {-39 -250 1036 750 }readonly def
